{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29142","headline":"陵阳春日寄汝洛旧游 · 许浑","name":"陵阳春日寄汝洛旧游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百年身世似飘蓬，泽国移家叠嶂中。\n万里绿波鱼恋钓，九重青汉鹤愁笼。\n西池水冷春岩雪，南浦花香晓树风。\n纵倒芳尊心不醉，故人多在洛城东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}